[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0010","text":"被小看了啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0020","text":"啊哈…………我们…………\n太好糊弄了是吧————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0030","text":"你们，想要的是这种东西吗………\n我想要的是这种东西吗………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0040","text":"别擅自替我做决定…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0050","text":"明明只有这条路了————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0060","text":"你懂吗……\n我的事————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0070","text":"我也…………还不懂…………\n所以————…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0080","text":"所以，从现在开始…………\n请让我看到更多的斑鸠路加。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0090","text":"哼…………\n………………随你便………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0100","text":"………………\n我走了…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
